  "description": "Oh Kyuri, a lifelong Jeju Island native and hopeless romantic novice, has only one goal in life—to turn her humble coffee shop into a thriving franchise. Love? Not on her radar. But her peaceful routine is shattered by an infuriatingly rude customer, Cha Sooin. Without hesitation, he takes a sip of her coffee and sneers,\n\n*\"This tastes like dirty mop water.\"*\n\nKyuri is convinced this man is nothing more than the worst customer she’s ever had. At least, until she sees him naked. Now, she’s restless, unable to sleep, and worst of all—feeling things she never expected…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
